                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I found interesting the concept of bringing VR to visual novels. This game is far from being perfect, but there is some potential here. The only thing I disliked was the VA; I’m sorry, but it was really bad. I understand that this is a free game, but the voices were so bad that I cannot overlook this. Also, sometimes the characters would say something and it was different from the text on the screen.\n\nI liked the art style and concept, it caught my attention. With a bit more of work, this VN can turn into something interesting, regarding the story itself and gameplay.\n\n5/10.",
